{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/945730-wonderful-machine-and-its-many-applications","id":945730,"title":"Wonderful Machine and its many applications","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-07T16:08:37-07:00","id":945730,"title":"Wonderful Machine and its many applications","content":"I really like the idea behind the spell Wonderful Machine (see below) and normally I can get creative enough to get a lot of mileage out of the most simple of spells. Wonderful Machine seems extremely qualified to also be used in such a way, but so far I have not been able to think of anything.<br /> <br /> So what I want to ask: Does anyone have any suggestions? Without the use of Life.<br /> <br /> Wonderful Machine (Matter \u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> Practice: Weaving<br /> Primary Factor: Potency<br /> Suggested Rote Skills: Crafts, Politics, Science<br /> This spell allows a mage to swiftly superimpose pieces of<br /> various objects into one another in such a way as to produce<br /> a desired result. With this spell, a mage could, for example,<br /> integrate a nail-gun and shotgun together to produce a weapon<br /> that fires a barrage of nails with each pull of the trigger.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12164-zaephyrus","name":"Zaephyrus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T16:19:39-07:00","id":945735,"title":"","content":"Make Super Mecha Wondrous Zombies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T20:27:44-07:00","id":945878,"title":"","content":"Wondrous machine basically justifies a Mage using bat gadgets or impersonating Iron Man.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T21:50:45-07:00","id":945946,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/945730-wonderful-machine-and-its-many-applications?p=945878#post945878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wondrous machine basically justifies a Mage using bat gadgets or impersonating Iron Man.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you add Life you could use literal bat gadgets: This bat spits bullets, this bat is a flashbang grenade, this bat is a taser... wait...<br /> <br /> OMG, tesla coil + mouse = Pikachu.<br /> Turtle + Fire extinguisher = Squirtle.<br /> Lighter + lizard = Charmander.<br /> Create a legacy that has wonderful machine and transform life as attainments, they make pokemon!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11888,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11888-custos-tenebrarum","user":"Custos Tenebrarum","date":". 08-08-2016, 12:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11888-custos-tenebrarum","name":"Custos Tenebrarum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T22:28:14-07:00","id":945955,"title":"","content":"add Space (either as a separate spell or a combined casting) to connect the item you are holding to a room or warehouse of assorted useful things and the possibilities are only limited by your ability to put awesome stuff into that place, and remember this is a Matter Mage we're talking about.<br /> <br /> Baseball Bat that Shoots like a Tank. Walking Stick that's also a flamethrower. A broom that works like a jetpack (strap in!) or motorcycle. A smartphone that works like a super computer with commercial grade internet connection.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T01:13:01-07:00","id":946011,"title":"","content":"A microwave/television!<br /> <br /> ... What? Doesn't anyone else get bored while heating their food?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4854-justin-sane","name":"Justin Sane","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T10:43:51-07:00","id":946276,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar9102_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"9102\" data-vbnamecard=\"9102\">WHW</a> : You just gave me a great idea for my planned Golem army. Now I just have to make it a mechanical Golem army so that it is actually covered by Wonderfull Machine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3279_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3279\" data-vbnamecard=\"3279\">Pale_Crusader</a> : As for the Baseballzooka, I would not use it. It seems to me that anyone that can get a bazooka is a lot better off just using Hidden Hoard, provided that they can actually take the recoil.<br /> The walking stick with a flamethrower is a cool idea. I am just wondering where I would get a flamethrower and how long the fuel reserves would last.<br /> The jetbroom sounds windy and I would first have to invent a safe jetpack.<br /> The smartphone thing I already did, reverse engineered how the spell made it work and used that to give the entire cabal the equivalent of current day smartphones in 2011.<br /> <br /> Good suggestions, so keep them coming.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4854-justin-sane\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4854\" data-vbnamecard=\"4854\">Justin Sane</a> : You mean you do not enjoy watching the Spinning Plate Show?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12164-zaephyrus","name":"Zaephyrus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T12:23:10-07:00","id":946365,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zaephyrus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/945730-wonderful-machine-and-its-many-applications?p=946276#post946276\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3279_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3279\" data-vbnamecard=\"3279\">Pale_Crusader</a> : As for the Baseballzooka, I would not use it. It seems to me that anyone that can get a bazooka is a lot better off just using Hidden Hoard, provided that they can actually take the recoil.</div> </div> </div> </div>But if you don't transfer the strength requirements of the bazooka, you have a recoilless baseballzooka.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Homebrew</b><br /> - CtL 2E: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1290961-additional-seeming-benefits-for-contracts-2e?p=1454478#post1454478\" target=\"_blank\">Seeming Benefits for every Contract</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1292-unahim","name":"Unahim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1292_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1080"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T14:18:42-07:00","id":946450,"title":"","content":"Bazookas use an open tube (at both ends) in which a rocket is fired. They don't have recoil.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4854-justin-sane","name":"Justin Sane","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T09:26:17-07:00","id":947000,"title":"","content":"Chainsaw-shotgun.<br /> <br /> Cellphone-taser.<br /> <br /> Grappling hook wristwatch.<br /> <br /> Yes, you can actually be a gonzo Mage James Bond!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T15:25:09-07:00","id":947258,"title":"","content":"Ladies and gentlemen, behold! Feast your eyes on the wondrous, unbelievable, amazing, WONDERFUL MACHINE!<br /> <br /> To the uneducated, it might appear an ordinary laptop, but no, the Wonderful Machine is anything but ordinary! Not only it is a fully functional, state-of-the-art edible portable computer, its many features allow it to double as:<ul><li>Cellphone</li> <li>Television</li> <li>Breathalyzer</li> <li>High-resolution ultra-slow-motion camera</li> <li>Electric stove</li> <li>Defibrillator</li> <li>Diesel generator</li> <li>Pillow case</li> <li>Power bank</li> <li>Suitcase</li> <li>Bolt cutter</li> <li>Analog turntable</li> <li>Spare wheel</li> <li>Turkey and bacon on rye sandwich</li> <li>Boat anchor (with up to 50ft of steel chain)</li> <li>Hood ornament</li> <li>Jimi Hendrix Bobblehead</li> <li>PEZ dispenser</li> <li>King-sized mattress</li> <li>Bookshelf</li> </ul>All for the low, low price of <s>your immortal soul</s> 29.99! Call now, and we'll include a wireless mouse also usable as a toothbrush!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">Batteries not included. Warranty void if used as a doorstop. Offer not valid in Oregon.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4854,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4854-justin-sane","user":"Justin Sane","date":". 08-09-2016, 06:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4854-justin-sane","name":"Justin Sane","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"319"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}